{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45493","headline":"与道侣同於水陆寺会宿 · 子兰","name":"与道侣同於水陆寺会宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"论道穷心少有朋，此时清话昔年曾。\n柿凋红叶铺寒井，鹄坠霜毛着定僧。\n风遰远声秋涧水，竹穿深色夜房灯。\n出门尽是劳生者，只此长闲几个能。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"子兰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}